  "The server closed the download early. Try again.": "服务器提前中断了下载，请重试。",
  "CD (16/44)": "CD（16 位/44.1 kHz）",
  "Best FLAC": "最佳 FLAC 音质",
  "Auto-download saves liked songs for offline playback. Lossless tries your music add-ons first and saves FLAC; without add-ons it uses the quality above. Wi-Fi Only blocks downloads on cellular data.": "自动下载会保存你喜欢的歌曲，供离线播放。无损下载会优先从音乐扩展查找并保存 FLAC；未安装扩展时，使用上方选择的音质。“仅 Wi-Fi”可阻止通过蜂窝网络下载。",
  "Add-on Quality picks which copy to look for in your add-ons: Auto takes the best FLAC available and falls back to JioSaavn/AAC 320 then YouTube; CD forces 16-bit / 44.1 kHz; Best FLAC keeps FLAC only (no 320 fallback). \"Allow Hi-Res\" unlocks 24-bit copies; with it off they are neither downloaded nor played (the iPhone DAC tops out at 24/48 and hi-res needs an external DAC). Dolby Atmos (E-AC3 5.1) is downmixed to stereo by iOS. Audio Quality picks the lossy pool: with Auto or High it races YouTube, JioSaavn and add-on AAC 320 and keeps the best; Standard and Low stay on YouTube and only use JioSaavn/AAC if YouTube has no stream. If \"Upgrade to best quality during playback\" is on, the app may switch mid-song with a short fade.": "“扩展音质”决定从扩展中查找哪个版本：自动会选择最佳 FLAC，不可用时依次尝试 JioSaavn/AAC 320 和 YouTube；CD 限定为 16 位/44.1 kHz；最佳 FLAC 仅使用 FLAC，不回退到 320 kbps。“允许高解析度”可启用 24 位版本；关闭后不会下载或播放这些版本。iPhone 的 DAC 最高支持 24 位/48 kHz，更高解析度需要外置 DAC。iOS 会将杜比全景声（E-AC3 5.1）混音为立体声。“音质”决定有损音源：自动或高音质会同时比较 YouTube、JioSaavn 和扩展中的 AAC 320，选择最佳音源；标准和低音质优先使用 YouTube，仅在无可用音源时尝试其他来源。启用“播放时提升音质”后，歌曲播放期间可能通过短暂淡入淡出切换音源。",
  "Off and Auto work with YouTube alone. CD, Best FLAC and Dolby Atmos need an installed music add-on, because the add-on is the search engine for those qualities. Add one in Settings → Integrations → Music Addons to unlock them.": "关闭和自动模式仅使用 YouTube 即可。CD、最佳 FLAC 和杜比全景声需要音乐扩展来查找对应音源。请前往“设置 → 集成 → 音乐扩展”添加。"
}
